# Build mode for the public Cloudflare deployment.
#
# The .env file on a developer machine may contain a RailRadar key. Vite
# compiles VITE_* values into the public browser bundle, so this mode leaves the
# key empty and sends RailRadar calls through the Worker proxy instead.
VITE_RAILRADAR_API_KEY=
VITE_RAILRADAR_API_BASE=/api/railradar
